{"The align-items mixin contains a non-standard property -ms-align-items (IE10 uses -ms-flex-align)": 0.458524614572525, "The order mixin uses legacy properties (-webkit-box-ordinal-group and -moz-box-ordinal-group) that are 1-based while the modern order property is 0-based - the value passed to legacy properties should be $val + 1": 0.7726150751113892, "The align-items mixin has inconsistent indentation (4 spaces instead of 2)": 0.1519213169813156, "Missing space in the standard align-items property": 0.06400290131568909, "Trailing whitespace on line 120": 0.07865329831838608, "Legacy properties like -webkit-box-align and -ms-flex-align use different value keywords (e.g., start/end instead of flex-start/flex-end)": 0.3031768798828125, "Legacy order properties do not support negative values": 0.07428689301013947, "Using a percentage (1.5%) for the gutter between avatar and text is problematic as it scales with container width, leading to insufficient spacing on mobile devices - a fixed unit like px or em is preferred": 0.4309028089046478, "The vertical padding (0.5em) from the previous implementation has been removed, which might negatively impact the vertical spacing of elements": 0.2890009880065918}